The chain id modifies the RNG so that parallel chains start with different seeds.  So when running in parallel this is okay,

seed=1 id=1
seed=1 id=2
seed=1 id=3
seed=1 id=4

but this is not,

seed=1 id=1
seed=1 id=1
seed=1 id=1
seed=1 id=1.

The former should be equivalent to something like,

seed=1
seed=2
seed=3
seed=4

and if it’s not then there’s something going wrong with the striding and the RNG.

