Great!  Daniel's the best one to talk to about it.

The big issue is that changes will impact PyStan, RStan, and CmdStan.

Rather than using unions, I'd recommend the Boost variant package,

  http://www.boost.org/doc/libs/1_55_0/doc/html/variant.html

which we're using in the parser.  I can help get that going for
a particular application if you need it.  The nice part about it
is that it gives you type-safe access to unions.

- Bob

