I think that “ARD” is what we call hierarchical or multilevel modeling in statistics. I have no objection to referring to the model as ARD also, I just don’t want ARD to be the main title.  I think ARD stands for “automatic relevance determination” but I don’t really like that expression, as I don’t really see it as any more automatic than any other Bayesian model.

